          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Youth athletes deserve more than adult sports nutrition scaled down into a smaller serving.</p><p>Age, stage of development, training demands, intended use, and total daily intake all matter when developing nutrition for young athletes. That’s why FUTR starts with the youth athlete — not an existing adult formula.</p><p>Every product is built around a defined purpose: what it is designed to support, when it is intended to be used, which ingredients belong, and the intended serving amount.</p><p><strong>The result is a sports nutrition system developed specifically with the routines and nutritional considerations of healthy, active youth in mind.</strong></p>",
