            "accordion_header": "EXPERT-LED FORMULATION + MULTIDISCIPLINARY REVIEW",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>FUTR formulas are developed through a multidisciplinary process informed by sports nutrition, pediatric nutrition, medicine, and performance.</p><p>Each formula is reviewed across key formulation considerations, including:</p><p>Ingredient rationale. Serving amount. Intended use. Age considerations. Potential ingredient interactions. Total daily intake.</p><p>Every ingredient has a defined purpose, and every formula is considered as a whole — not simply as a list of individual ingredients.</p>",
            "page": ""
