        "accordion_De8PBk": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_header": "EVIDENCE-INFORMED INGREDIENT SELECTION",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>We don’t formulate around trends, hype, or the longest ingredient list.</p><p>Ingredients are selected based on their intended role, available scientific evidence, serving amount, and fit within the complete formula.</p><p>Because an ingredient that makes sense on its own still needs to make sense within the formula, at its intended serving amount, and for its intended use.</p><p>The goal isn’t more ingredients. It’s purposeful ingredients, intentional amounts, and a clear reason for each one.</p>",
            "page": ""
