            "accordion_header": "DESIGNED AS A SYSTEM",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "text": "<p>Each FUTR formula is designed to work independently, but we also consider how the products fit together.</p><p>Shared nutrients and total intake are considered across the system when products are used as directed.</p><p>We’re not simply developing individual products. We’re building a connected nutrition system around the full cycle of youth sport.</p>",
